Dear natverse community/ Dr Jefferis,
Nice library
Recently, i was processing FAFB dataset, and i saw the brain surface in this library (https://github.com/natverse/elmr), the original resolution for FAFB dataset is `4x4x40nm`, so i think if i have the skeletons of this resolution i can just map them together.
But i just wondering how to apply this template on other resolution, for example on `8x8x40nm`? How to change the template size to match it?
and should i change the coordinate of my skeletons datasets to match the FAFB template?
Sorry to bother you.
Best Wishes,
Chaoyu.

