  .     na.action = na.action, ...)
11. xformpoints.cmtkreg(reg, points, FallBackToAffine = FallBackToAffine,
  .     na.action = na.action, ...)
12. cmtk.streamxform(points, reg, direction, transformtype)
13. stop("Error running CMTK streamxform!")

I found a similar issue here <https://github.com/natverse/nat.templatebrains/issues/38>. Following the suggestions, I ran `cmtk.bindir()` which returned `/usr/lib/cmtk/bin`. I then ran `cmtk.dof2mat(version = TRUE)` which  returned `3.3.1`. I did install cmtk using `sudo apt-get install cmtk` instead of directly from https://www.nitrc.org/projects/cmtk/, but I don't think this should make a difference? Any help is much appreciated.

